<title>SOUTH AFRICA: SMG Hold buys broker Mathison &amp; Hollidge.</title>
<headline>SMG Hold buys broker Mathison &amp; Hollidge.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Republic Bank Ltd pyramid holding company SMG Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had acquired the entire issued share capital of, and certain shareholders' claims against stockbroker Mathison &amp; Hollidge (M&amp;H) from January 1.</p>
<p>The group said the acquisition would have no material effect on the net asset value of SMG, nor any immediate effect on the earnings of SMG.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
